# 🔟 Best Practice Tip

Instead of directly styling via JS repeatedly:

Prefer:

```js
turnGreen.classList.add('active')
```

And define style in CSS:

```css
.active {
  background-color: pink;
  padding: 10px;
}
```

Reason:

* Cleaner separation of concerns
* Better maintainability
* Scales better in real projects

